5,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us begin with wisdom. I wish to see the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... I think I will look at the capital budget and software allowance, and maybe the vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know about network coverage at customer plants! And also the in-house developer availability. That sounds exciting!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I will examine the misrouted deliveries in the incident logs and the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will check the staffing of the coordination group and the handling of vendor queries.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
