25,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It seems we often fail when we demand daily input from everyone. Narrow, specialized tools tend to survive much better.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital budget is frozen, but we have some room in the recurring software allowance. Licences might get expensive as we scale.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh no! Network coverage at plants is terrible, and getting devices approved takes forever. Also, our developers are super busy!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We are losing an hour a day just copying records. Misrouted deliveries are happening because different units have different addresses.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The coordination group is understaffed, and clerks are wasting time asking for the same certificates repeatedly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, your findings on duplicate records and misrouting suggest a systemic failure in how we share basic data.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the developers are unavailable, we might need to rely on vendors, but the budget is tight.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, that's true! We can't just build anything we want if the network is broken too.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,The inefficiency is tangible. We are paying for time spent on redundant manual entry.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Asuka,,Exactly. The administrative burden is high because we lack a single source of truth for vendor and supplier data.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Servas,,"We must avoid a tool that requires everyone to change their daily habits, or it will be dropped.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'm worried about the long-term costs of per-head licences if we choose a broad tool.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Sakura,,Maybe something that doesn't need a constant network connection? Or something very simple?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,A solution for the data duplication would solve the misrouting and the copying time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We need to reduce the manual workload for the coordination group and the clerks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
