50,3,1,talk,Servas,,"The candidates are A: Supplier Data Hub, B: Workflow Assistant, C: Training Studio, and D: Field Service App.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"A seems safe for the budget if it's a central repository, but B might be too many licences.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"D sounds cool, but I found out the network is bad! It might not work.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,A directly addresses the misrouted deliveries and the time lost to copying records.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Asuka,,A would also stop the clerks from requesting the same certificates multiple times.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Servas,,"A is a standardization effort. While some fail, a central catalog is a narrow enough utility to survive.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, do you think A is the most practical choice given the current errors?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Sakura,,What about B? It helps with notes! But maybe A is more important for the company?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, A solves a concrete loss of time and money. B is just a convenience.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Asuka,,I agree with Ryuji. A reduces the actual workload for the staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Servas,,I support A. It targets the root of the data fragmentation I've seen in previous years.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. It seems the most logical way to use the software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I guess A is the winner! I wanted D, but the network is just too scary.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,A is the only choice that addresses the operational failures on the floor.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Asuka,,It is the most efficient use of resources to fix the supplier data.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
